          },
          "datePublished": "2026-01-09",
          "reviewBody": "I had a real problem with this recipe... portion control! :-)  I didn't have fresh basil but I made your basil vinaigrette for another recipe and used some of it here.  It was perfect!  And I loved the little pops of acidity from the roasted cherry tomatoes.  I will try not to eat so much the next time I mak it !"
        },
        {
