          },
          "datePublished": "2026-05-22",
          "reviewBody": "I've many of your recipes; all have been delicious but never have taken the time to review. This roasted veg pasta was delicious. My husband and I will be eating it all weekend! When I need a source for recipes from someone I trust, I go to you. There are no throw away recipes on your site. Thank you!"
        },
        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "reviewRating": {
            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": "5"
          },
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Mary"
          },
          "datePublished": "2026-08-09",
          "reviewBody": "Wow! This is REALLY good. A perfect recipe for the bounty of our garden. Used mezzi rigatoni. Added a couple of garden Italian eggplants that we had on hand. Don’t omit the rosemary! It adds wonderful depth of flavor.  My only other comment is that this does not feed 4 people - it’s so good that 3 of us finished it off handily and probably could have had more. SO good!"
        }
